This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It drives core's own reconcile/ scripts (ledger-reverify.sh, preclassify.sh, emit-report.sh,
self-update-gate.sh, unregistered-drift.sh, layer-drift.sh, hard-blockers.sh, apply.sh). Those
scripts are installed and a consumer cannot edit them in place (ai-dlc-core-guard.sh), so on a
consumer the fixture would only re-derive an answer about this repository's sources.
